      "title": "MS_WORKFLOW_NOTE",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Music Suite Official Workflow\n\nID: minimax-h3.i2v.v1\nPurpose: image-to-video from MS_INPUT_FIRST_FRAME.\n\nThis UI graph mirrors api/minimax-h3.i2v.v1.workflow_API.json\n(Music Suite production contract): INT8 FL2VA/Ref2VA, 16 beta steps,\nres_multistep, EasyCache 0.2 / 0.15-0.95, 1024x576 x 124 frames @ 24 fps.\n\nPatchable / titled nodes:\n- MS_INPUT_TRANSFORMER — diffusion model filename\n- MS_INPUT_CONDITIONING — prompt, width, height, length (+ frames / refs)\n- MS_INPUT_STEPS — scheduler steps\n- MS_INPUT_SEED — noise seed\n- MS_EASYCACHE — cache thresholds\n- MS_OUTPUT_VIDEO — save prefix\n\nRequired assets (ComfyUI/models/):\n- diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n- vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n- vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n\nManual validation:\n1. Import this JSON into ComfyUI (Load -> workflow).\n2. Confirm model filenames match your install.\n3. Set a prompt (and frames/refs for non-t2v).\n4. Queue Prompt; confirm one video under output/music-suite/minimax-h3/.\n5. If you edit the graph, re-export API JSON before changing Music Suite.\n\nSet MS_INPUT_FIRST_FRAME to your start image before queueing."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
